{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24618","headline":"览卢子蒙侍御旧诗多与微之唱和感今伤昔因赠子蒙题於卷後 · 白居易","name":"览卢子蒙侍御旧诗多与微之唱和感今伤昔因赠子蒙题於卷後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早闻元九咏君诗，恨与卢君相识迟。\n今日逢君开旧卷，卷中多道赠微之。\n相看掩泪情难说，别有伤心事岂知。\n闻道咸阳坟上树，已抽三丈白杨枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}